## Behavior
- Typed counters, not EOT pump/legacy display; persist through cleanup and alter actual P/T.
- Landfall is controller-scoped; repeated/opponent landfall controls covered.
- Queued Baloths landfall still creates its token after the source is bounced; source-left counter effect is a normal no-op.
- Pest death gains 1 life exactly once after full drain, causes no opponent drain, then the token ceases.
- Fixed an over-broad repair-3 validator predicate found by tests: archival Removed-reference rejection now applies only to tokens, preserving legitimate non-token APNAP source-left provenance.

